            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An encoder for encoding an audio signal. The encoder is configured to encode the audio signal in a transform domain or filter-bank domain, wherein the encoder is configured to determine spectral coefficients of the audio signal for a current frame and at least one previous frame, wherein the encoder is configured to selectively apply predictive encoding to a plurality of individual spectral coefficients or groups of spectral coefficients which are separated by at least one spectral coefficient.</p>
            </abstract>
